    "titleText": {
      "es": "Los cocos están tan a la izquierda que no entraban en la gráfica. ¿Alguna vez has pasado una hora intentando abrir un coco con una piedra? Putos cocos.",
      "en": "Coconuts are so far to the left that they did not fit on the chart. Have you ever spent an hour trying to open a coconut with a rock? Fucking coconuts.",
      "noteEn": "The official English title text says half an hour; the Spanish archive deliberately says one hour. Both extend the chart's joke by placing coconuts beyond its difficult-to-eat edge."
    },
